{"parentUuid":"b9439c60-5878-474e-aebe-51b9b634ded2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cffy9RMUNAHwym6gZy9nR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8107,"cache_read_input_tokens":124556,"output_tokens":1269,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":257},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8107,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1269,"cache_read_input_tokens":124556,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8107,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8107},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cffy9R38PRKghcv1mnfF9","type":"assistant","uuid":"6676af86-b847-42f6-945f-248c4b5c2927","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:54:21.578Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk","sessionId":"79c3b8a7-06a2-4fb1-8964-a4968e4c0492","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"6676af86-b847-42f6-945f-248c4b5c2927","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cffy9RMUNAHwym6gZy9nR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan is live. Project at [line-down-desk/](projects/line-down-desk/), tracker at [MILESTONES.md](projects/line-down-desk/MILESTONES.md), and five agents are running in parallel.\n\n**Architecture decision that makes parallelism safe:** everything flows through one frozen contract — [EVENT-SCHEMA.md](projects/line-down-desk/docs/EVENT-SCHEMA.md). Agents emit events, the UI replays them, and live vs. replay is invisible to the UI. That means the UI track can finish without waiting on a single working integration, and you have a demo by 15:15 regardless of how the SDKs behave.\n\n**The five tracks:**\n\n| Track | Due | Owns |\n|---|---|---|\n| MOSS | 14:20 GO/NO-GO | Does image embedding actually exist? Then the matching code |\n| RECON | 14:25 | Real API signatures for all five sponsors |\n| DATA | 14:35 | BOM, candidates, QVL, counterfeit fixtures, full mock run |\n| UI | 15:15 | The war room + replay engine (largest scored deliverable) |\n| AGENTS | 16:00 | ZooWork agents, BAND room, Tavily/Entire adapters |\n\nEach writes only to its own paths and its own `status/` file — no cross-track edits, which is how parallel work usually corrupts a repo with three hours left.\n\n**Hard freeze at 16:30.** Whatever is real by then ships; the rest stays on replay. The cut ladder in the tracker is ordered — follow it without debating.\n\n## Three things only you can do, starting now\n\n1. **Export the API keys.** Every agent is writing against env vars and none can test without them. They'll each document exact names in their `status/` file as they land.\n2. **Get a physical DIMM and photograph the chip markings.** This is your X-Factor asset and no agent can produce it. Ask around the venue — someone has a stick of RAM, or pull one from a laptop. Shoot a genuine one plus one with a deliberately altered label for the counterfeit beat.\n3. **Pick your presenter now**, not at 16:45. They should read the 7-beat spine in the tracker and start shaping the 3-minute narration while the build runs.\n\n## Two calls I made that you should sanity-check\n\n- **Replay mode is architecture, not a fallback.** With 3 hours, guaranteeing a demo exists beats maximising live integrations. If it comes to it, say out loud that audit replay of a sourcing decision is exactly what IATF 16949 traceability requires — it's a real feature, so don't apologise for it.\n- **Engineering's block must be a real QVL lookup**, not a hardcoded string. I made that explicit to the AGENTS track because a judge may well ask, and it's the difference between a demo and a puppet show.\n\nI'll report back as each agent completes. Meanwhile — do you want me to draft the 3-minute presentation script against the 7-beat spine, so your presenter has something to rehearse before the build is finished?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8107,"cache_read_input_tokens":124556,"output_tokens":1269,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":257},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8107,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1269,"cache_read_input_tokens":124556,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8107,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8107},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cffy9R38PRKghcv1mnfF9","type":"assistant","uuid":"635f8b72-e1b8-475b-a838-0c69d32afdec","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:54:36.636Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk","sessionId":"79c3b8a7-06a2-4fb1-8964-a4968e4c0492","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
