{"parentUuid":"c94db354-7c82-49d2-aca8-50c0b53bc934","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cffya3EQ9xHgeTGFQXezU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**`~/projects/line-down-desk/.env`** — create it from the template:\n\n```bash\ncd ~/projects/line-down-desk\ncp .env.example .env\nopen -e .env        # or: code .env\n```\n\nIt's gitignored, so it won't be committed or pushed.\n\n**Correction to what I told you five minutes ago — only one ZooWork variable is real:**\n\n```\nZOOWORK_API_KEY=zwp_live_...\nMOSS_PROJECT_ID=\nMOSS_PROJECT_KEY=\nTAVILY_API_KEY=\nBAND_API_KEY=\n```\n\nThe AGENTS track grepped the shipped SDK (`@zoowork-ai/sdk` 0.10.2). Three of the five vars I gave you are dead config: `ZOOWORK_ORG_ID` doesn't exist (the gateway derives the tenant from the key), `ZOOWORK_AGENT_ID` isn't an SDK input (ids come back from `createAgent()`), and `ZOOWORK_WEBHOOK_SECRET` is only for inbound webhooks we don't receive. My earlier list came from grepping env-var-shaped strings in the skill docs, which matched names the docs explicitly say don't exist.\n\n**The one that would actually have cost you time:** leave `ZOOWORK_BASE_URL` **unset**. The default already includes the `/service/v1` prefix, and a wrong value 404s every call — a confusing failure to debug at 16:00.\n\nFor **Entire**, don't put a token in `.env` — run `entire login` in the terminal instead.\n\n`.env.example` in the repo now documents all of this inline, so the file itself tells you what not to set.\n\nOnce the key is in, the AGENTS track can report what the ZooWork model catalog actually offers — that determines whether the vision-OCR step runs live or falls back to the fixture transcription for beat 5."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2349,"cache_read_input_tokens":147879,"output_tokens":731,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":101},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2349,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":147879,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2349,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2349},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cffya2raRM3Wpd4ALv1qc","type":"assistant","uuid":"6505172d-1ecd-4464-986e-b46f3906b9a8","timestamp":"2026-10-03T20:59:59.700Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk","sessionId":"79c3b8a7-06a2-4fb1-8964-a4968e4c0492","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
