{"parentUuid":"cea317e3-8706-46c7-a750-e24d2a4b5824","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CffycCxbP4omzDmeA9yp5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Opened: [.env](.env) in [line-down-desk/](projects/line-down-desk/)\n\nIt already existed (created 14:00), so I used `cp -n` — nothing you'd already typed was overwritten.\n\nFill in these five:\n\n```\nZOOWORK_API_KEY=\nMOSS_PROJECT_ID=\nMOSS_PROJECT_KEY=\nTAVILY_API_KEY=\nBAND_API_KEY=\n```\n\nLeave the commented-out `ZOOWORK_*` lines alone — the file explains inline why each is dead config, and `ZOOWORK_BASE_URL` in particular will 404 every call if set.\n\nSeparately, in a terminal: `entire login`.\n\nTell me when the key is in and I'll have the AGENTS track dump the ZooWork model catalog — that's what decides whether beat 5's vision-OCR runs live or falls back to the fixture transcription."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":420,"cache_read_input_tokens":150990,"output_tokens":306,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":420,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":150990,"cache_creation_input_tokens":420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":420},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffycCc2FJY4usCfoSvdQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"ffbd7b9a-8b91-4b98-bf7e-ad97b9fd1333","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:00:23.630Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/proje