{"parentUuid":"78d969d5-3945-448c-a2f8-d22ed029179f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CffzPATHibdcTPkP8H19a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan mode just switched on — almost certainly because **Shift+Tab cycled one stop too far**. That's my fault for not warning you: the cycle is accept-edits → bypass → **plan mode**, and plan mode blocks all edits, which is the opposite of what you asked for.\n\nLet me capture the remaining path so you can approve out of it in one keystroke."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3275,"cache_read_input_tokens":182894,"output_tokens":2180,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":590},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3275,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2180,"cache_read_input_tokens":182894,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3275,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3275},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CffzPA8hNJnmfjx6aMZXw","type":"assistant","uuid":"92c85dd5-bf2a-40a2-8ba0-66c65925675f","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:10:40.590Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk","sessionId":"79c3b8a7-06a2-4fb1-8964-a4968e4c0492","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"dreamy-hugging-sutton"}
{"parentUuid":"92c85dd5-bf2a-40a2-8ba0-66c65925675f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CffzPATHibdcTPkP8H19a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A8ihLMMsqX5HH5XzurCyFu","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/.claude/plans/dreamy-hugging-sutton.md","content":"# LINEDOWN — remaining execution to 17:00\n\n## Context\n\nPlan mode was entered accidentally at ~15:05 (Shift+Tab cycles accept-edits → bypass → **plan\nmode**, one stop too far while disabling permission prompts). Nothing about the project changed.\nThis file exists only so you can approve out of plan mode and let the four running agents keep\nbuilding.\n\n**The plan of record is [`~/projects/line-down-desk/MILESTONES.md`](~/projects/line-down-desk/MILESTONES.md)** — milestones, cut ladder,\nrisk register and a full decisions log. This is a summary of what remains, not a new plan.\n\nProject: LINEDOWN, a procurement war room that sources a qualified alternate DDR5 RDIMM after\nan allocation cut and proves to an auditor why it chose what it chose. Hackathon submission at\n**17:00**, presentations 18:00.\n\n## State at 15:05\n\n| Track | Status |\n|---|---|\n| RECON | ✅ complete 14:18 — `docs/INTEGRATION.md`, all five sponsors |\n| DATA | ✅ core shipped — 55-event run + 7 JSON fixtures; finishing SVG fixtures + `status/data.md` |\n| MOSS | 🔄 image embedding NO-GO; text-match path building |\n| UI | 🔄 M5 due 15:15 — full run rendering from mock events |\n| AGENTS | 🔄 ZooWork `custom_tools` gate, orchestrator, adapters |\n\nRepo: https://github.com/abhijitbetigeri/line-down-desk (private)\nEntire: CLI 0.11.3 installed, `entire enable` active, **not logged in**.\n\n## Remaining work\n\n1. **UI M5 (15:15)** — full run renders from `data/mock-events.json`. Must unwrap the file:\n   `const events = Array.isArray(d) ? d : d.events`. Three hero shots: `block.raised` e026,\n   `counterfeit.flagged` e037, `approval.requested` e043 (replay pauses for the presenter's click).\n2. **AGENTS M6–M10 (15:30–16:20)** — five ZooWork agent defs; Engineering's veto gated by\n   `custom_tools` + `resolveCustomToolCall` so the block is runtime-enforced, not prompt\n   convention; Tavily + Moss + Entire adapters; cache a real Tavily response early.\n3. **MOSS M7 (15:45)** — `findEquivalents()` + `matchMarking()` returning real `latencyMs`.\n4. **FREEZE 16:30** — swap the live stream in, or stay on replay. Follow the cut ladder in\n   MILESTONES.md without debating it.\n5. **16:40** — record a clean run, verify replay fallback.\n6. **17:00 submit. 17:45 rehearsed twice, under 3:00.**\n\n## Blocking on the user\n\n- `entire login --device` in the repo — interactive browser auth, no agent can do it, no token\n  env var exists. Until it lands, beat 7 stays mocked.\n- Keys in `.env`: `ZOOWORK_API_KEY`, `TAVILY_API_KEY`, `MOSS_PROJECT_ID`, `MOSS_PROJECT_KEY`.\n- Photograph a real DIMM — one genuine, one with an altered label. SVG fallbacks exist; paths\n  are swappable without touching the event log.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cd ui && npm run dev` → full 2.4-minute run plays; Space pauses, R restarts, → skips beats.\n- Replay pauses at `approval.requested`; the Approve button resumes into `po.drafted`.\n- `entire why <file>:<line>` prints the prompt behind the QVL change (after login).\n- Rehearse twice against the real projector. Live execution is effectively double-weighted\n  in the judging rubric.\n\n## Not doing\n\nNo new features. No scope beyond the seven beats. The Market agent is first on the cut ladder\nand only lands if everything else is done.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3275,"cache_read_input_tokens":182894,"output_tokens":2180,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":590},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_ti