{"parentUuid":"bf8231f6-5752-45d3-b88b-2a6ebdc3978d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfg4R7bfJBSCPoPKwMztX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WFY4n1gXiybZxu8KK6Qzjt","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk/README.md","old_string":"| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines, with a Critic that can block. |","new_string":"| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines. (BAND has no veto primitive; the blocking gate is ZooWork's `custom_tools`, which halts the run inside the runtime until our backend resolves it.) |"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2395,"cache_read_input_tokens":216365,"output_tokens":842,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":297},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2395,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":842,"cache_read_input_tokens":216365,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2395,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2395},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01WFY4n1gXiybZxu8KK6Qzjt":{"file_path":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk/README.md","old_string":"| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines, with a Critic that can block. |","new_string":"| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines. (BAND has no veto primitive; the blocking gate is ZooWork's `custom_tools`, which halts the run inside the runtime until our backend resolves it.) |"}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cfg4R6NVgXGYwsg3SXLtP","type":"assistant","uuid":"d81e455f-dcf5-4383-accd-4a7381d7e8a9","timestamp":"2026-10-03T22:03:31.325Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk","sessionId":"79c3b8a7-06a2-4fb1-8964-a4968e4c0492","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"dreamy-hugging-sutton"}
{"parentUuid":"d81e455f-dcf5-4383-accd-4a7381d7e8a9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"845a61e8-d23a-4813-b7e7-6c1250033c85","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WFY4n1gXiybZxu8KK6Qzjt","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk/README.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"602b6822-e1ff-454f-956d-2d830015804f","timestamp":"2026-10-03T22:03:32.392Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk/README.md","oldString":"| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines, with a Critic that can block. |","newString":"| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines. (BAND has no veto primitive; the blocking gate is ZooWork's `custom_tools`, which halts the run inside the runtime until our backend resolves it.) |","originalFile":"# LINEDOWN\n\n**The sourcing desk that keeps the line running.**\n\nBuilt at the AI Commerce Gallery hackathon — Walt Disney Family Museum, 3 Oct 2026.\n\n---\n\nA server ODM's qualified DDR5 RDIMM just had its allocation cut 40%. A 480-node AI cluster\nships in 11 days. LINEDOWN is the agent desk that sources a *qualified* alternate before the\nline stops — and proves to an auditor why it chose what it chose.\n\nThe AI boom broke the memory market. HBM capacity cannibalised conventional DRAM supply, and\nserver DDR5 got scarce. This is how a manufacturer buys through it.\n\n## What it does\n\n1. An allocation cut opens a war room. A money counter starts burning.\n2. **Tavily** pulls live spot pricing, distributor stock and allocation news.\n3. **Moss** decodes the part number and finds cross-vendor equivalents on spec — on-device, sub-10ms.\n4. **Engineering blocks** the cheapest option: not on the platform QVL.\n5. A broker offer looks too good. Photograph the module's chip markings → **Moss** matches a\n   remarked/counterfeit pattern → rejected.\n6. A qualified alternate is approved by a human, with one click. PO drafted.\n7. **Entire** commits the QVL change with the full agent session attached. `entire why`\n   prints the prompt behind the decision — the answer an auditor needs six months later.\n\n## Stack\n\n| Sponsor | Role |\n|---|---|\n| **ZooWork** | Hosts every agent. Agent → Session → Events; the event stream is what the UI renders. |\n| **Moss** | On-device multimodal search: part-number equivalence and chip-marking matching. |\n| **Tavily** | Spot pricing, distributor stock, lead times, allocation news. |\n| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines, with a Critic that can block. |\n| **Entire** | Session-attached commits. Git tells you what changed; Entire tells you why. |\n\n## Run it\n\n```bash\ncp .env.example .env    # fill in keys\ncd ui && npm install && npm run dev\n```\n\nThe UI consumes an event list conforming to [`docs/EVENT-SCHEMA.md`](docs/EVENT-SCHEMA.md).\nLive mode and replay mode are indistinguishable to it — replay is a real feature, since audit\nreplay of a sourcing decision is what IATF 16949 traceability requires.\n\n- Plan and status: [`MILESTONES.md`](MILESTONES.md)\n- Per-track progress: [`status/`](status/)\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":32,"oldLines":7,"newStart":32,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | **ZooWork** | Hosts every agent. Agent → Session → Events; the event stream is what the UI renders. |"," | **Moss** | On-device multimodal search: part-number equivalence and chip-marking matching. |"," | **Tavily** | Spot pricing, distributor stock, lead times, allocation news. |","-| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines, with a Critic that can block. |","+| **BAND** | The room — agents across company lines. (BAND has no veto primitive; the blocking gate is ZooWork's `custom_tools`, which halts the run inside the runtime until our backend resolves it.) |"," | **Entire** | Session-attached commits. Git tells you what changed; Entire tells you why. |"," "," ## Run it"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d81e455f-dcf5-4383-accd-4a7381d7e8a9","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk","sessionId":"79c3b8a7-06a2-4fb1-8964-a4968e4c0492","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"dreamy-hugging-sutton"}
