tion 1** — struck through and marked resolved with your reasoning, so nobody re-opens it.\n- **`status/pitch.md`** — ask to DATA closed, decision recorded, and the BAND note updated to reflect that you fixed `README.md` yourself. That closes the last place a judge could find us contradicting ourselves on BAND.\n\nRemaining open items in `status/pitch.md` are unchanged and all belong to other tracks: the static pre-roll state for the 12-second opening (fallback already written in as assumption 5), mouse-reachability of the Approve gate, and the 16:30 live-vs-replay call that decides which version of Q3/Q10 the presenter rehearses. Nothing further from me unless the freeze moves one of those.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>110102</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>27</tool_uses><duration_ms>526750</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
