{"parentUuid":"b4d0eae2-9f3f-490a-a26a-b9b71c77f2d9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfg5DGuHiNMuWGKPp499J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XVQ12SL2wGba22xNBAa6gj","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk/MILESTONES.md","old_string":"## STATUS AT 15:40 — read this first\n\n**Event log verified:** 55 events, all 7 beats at correct timings, **0 events missing `plain`**,\n`ui/node_modules` present. The demo's spine is sound.\n\n**The one thing blocking a running demo:** `ui/app/page.tsx` does not exist yet, so nothing\nmounts. UI agent is on it, writing that first. RoomFeed / CaseFile / StageBar follow.\n\n**All four agents hit a simultaneous infrastructure stall at ~15:30** (watchdog, not their work)\nand were resumed at 15:35. If they stall again, the fallback is to write `app/page.tsx` by hand\nagainst the components already on disk — everything else the page needs exists.\n\n**Waiting on the user (offline until ~16:35):** `entire login --device`, the four API keys,\nDIMM photos. All three are upgrades, not dependencies — every adapter is fixture-first and\nproduces a valid run with zero keys.","new_string":"## 🔒 FREEZE CALL — 16:30. Read this first.\n\n### WE DEMO ON THE REPLAY LOG (`data/mock-events.json`). Decided, not provisional.\n\nIt is complete and validated: 55 events, every beat present, **55/55 payloads carry `plain`**,\nall cross-file totals reconcile. AGENTS' live run is missing `plain` on 14 of 40 events and\n**has no beat 5 at all** — no counterfeit catch, which is the never-cut X-Factor moment.\n\nSay it plainly on stage if asked: audit replay of a sourcing decision is exactly what\nIATF 16949 traceability requires. It is a feature. Do not apologise for it.\n\n### Verified working\n\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` → clean, exit 0\n- Dev server up, HTTP 200, title `LINEDOWN — Sourcing Desk`\n- 4 marking SVGs on disk; 5 fixtures + sidecars + 194-row flat marking file\n- Numbers reconcile: PO $1,068,134.40 · block cost $209,203.20 · saved **$2,487,600**\n\n### ⚠️ Stage risk — ports\n\n**3000 and 3001 are occupied on this machine** (3000 serves an unrelated app, \"Mise OS\").\nOurs came up on **3002**. Curling 3000 returns a confident HTTP 200 for the wrong application.\n**Before going on stage, confirm the browser tab reads `LINEDOWN — Sourcing Desk`.**\n\n### Still open\n\n- UI: browser verification + the three screenshots (submission artifact if live fails)\n- AGENTS: beat 5 + `plain` — upgrade path only, does not gate the demo\n- User: `entire login --device`, four keys, DIMM photos — all upgrades, none are dependencies"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3513,"cache_read_input_tokens":229369,"output_tokens":1213,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":134},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3513,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1213,"cache_read_input_tokens":229369,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3513,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3513},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01XVQ12SL2wGba22xNBAa6gj":{"file_path":"/Users/abhijitbetigeri/projects/line-down-desk/MILESTONES.md","old_string":"## STATUS AT 15:40 — read this first\n\n**Event log verified:** 55 events, all 7 beats at correct timings, **0 events missing `plain`**,\n`ui/node_modules` present. The demo's spine is sound.\n\n**The one thing blocking a running demo:** `ui/app/page.tsx` does not exist yet, so nothing\nmounts. UI agent is on it, writing that first. RoomFee